<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT HUNGARY 4-1 IN EUROPEAN U-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWITZERLAND BEAT HUNGARY 4-1 IN EUROPEAN U-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>WINTERTHUR, Switzerland 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland beat Hungary 4-1 (halftime 2-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship group three qualifier on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Switzerland 4 Hungary 1 (2-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Switzerland - Hakan Yakin 37, Patrick De Napoli 43 Boris</p>
<p>Smiljanic 71, 75 pen</p>
<p>Hungary - Istvan Sira 50</p>
<p>Attendance - 1,200</p>
<p>	Standings	  P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts</p>
<p> 1. Norway		 4  3  1  0 15  5 10</p>
<p> 2. France		 3  2  1  0  4  1  7</p>
<p> 3. Finland		3  1  1  1  3  4  4</p>
<p> 4. Switzerland	  4  1  1  2  8 10  4</p>
<p> 5. Hungary		4  0  0  4  2 11  0</p>
</text>
